{"날짜": "2026-09-17", "시험지명": "이산고_고2_2025_2_중간", "루프ID": "20260917-CL-G2A-4e3ef02c", "문항": {"17": {"발문": "<div class=\"print\"><p class=\"first\">최고차항의 계수가 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math>인 두 삼차함수 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>가 다음 조건을 만족시킨다. 이때, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>의 값은?</p><p><div class=\"box\"><div class=\"bl\">(가) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math></div><div class=\"bl\">(나) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><munder><mrow><mi>lim</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>n</mi></mrow></munder><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>3</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></semant